msgstr "Nepodarilo sa povoliť overenie totožnosti pomocou JWT"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To implement SSO you will need to add a new endpoint to your app. You can connect Metabase to your identity provider using JSON Web Tokens (JWT) to authenticate people. Enabling JWT authentication will also create a signing key and enable group sync."
msgstr "Na implementáciu SSO budete musieť do svojej aplikácie pridať nový endpoint. Metabase môžete pripojiť k poskytovateľovi identity pomocou JSON Web Tokenov (JWT) na overenie ľudí. Povolenie overenia totožnosti pomocou JWT tiež vytvorí podpisový kľúč a povolí synchronizáciu skupín."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "This is where Metabase will redirect login requests"
msgstr "Sem bude Metabase presmerúvať požiadavky na prihlásenie"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Enable JWT authentication and continue"
msgstr "Povoľte overenie totožnosti pomocou JWT a pokračujte"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/hooks/use-get-embedding-hub-steps.ts
msgid "Configure SSO"
msgstr "Nastaviť SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Set up JWT authentication"
msgstr "Nastaviť overenie totožnosti pomocou JWT"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Add a new endpoint to your app"
msgstr "Pridať nový endpoint do vašej aplikácie"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Test that JWT authentication is working correctly"
msgstr "Otestujte, že overenie totožnosti pomocou JWT funguje správne"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Failed to save SSO test status"
msgstr "Nepodarilo sa uložiť stav testu SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try logging in with SSO. Did it work?"
msgstr "Skúste sa prihlásiť pomocou SSO. Fungovalo to?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To check if JWT authentication was configured successfully, open Metabase in a different browser or in a private tab and try logging in to your account using single sign-on (SSO). Is login working correctly?"
msgstr "Ak chcete overiť, že overenie totožnosti pomocou JWT bolo úspešne nakonfigurované, otvorte Metabase v inom prehliadači alebo v súkromnej karte a skúste sa prihlásiť do svojho účtu pomocou jednotného prihlásenia (SSO). Funguje prihlásenie správne?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "No, I couldn't log in"
msgstr "Nie, nepodarilo sa mi prihlásiť"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Log in works, I'm done"
msgstr "Prihlásenie funguje, mám hotovo"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Riešenie problémov"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try the steps below before testing JWT authentication again. If nothing works, consider contacting support."
msgstr "Skúste kroky nižšie predtým, než budete overenie totožnosti pomocou JWT testovať znova. Ak nič nezaberie, zvážte kontaktovanie podpory."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "404 error after SSO sign-in"
msgstr "Chyba 404 po prihlásení cez SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after clicking on \"Sign in with SSO\", the browser returns a 404 error, make sure the value of the JWT SSO URI in admin settings / auth / JWT is pointing to your endpoint and your endpoint is up and running and available."
msgstr "Ak po kliknutí na \"Sign in with SSO\" prehliadač vráti chybu 404, skontrolujte, že hodnota JWT SSO URI v nastaveniach správcu / overenie totožnosti / JWT smeruje na váš endpoint a že váš endpoint beží a je dostupný."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "JWT decryption error: \"Message seems corrupt\""
msgstr "Chyba dešifrovania JWT: \"Message seems corrupt\""

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\" there was an issue decrypting signed JWT. Ensure METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET has the right value."
msgstr "Ak po presmerovaní z vašej aplikácie do Metabase uvidíte \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\", nastal problém s dešifrovaním podpísaného JWT. Uistite sa, že METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET má správnu hodnotu."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Tenant ID mismatch error"
msgstr "Chyba nesúladu Tenant ID"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", your application is trying to sign in a the user with the wrong tenant slug. Review @tenant claim in the JWT and ensure it matches the tenant this tenant user belongs to."
msgstr "Ak po presmerovaní z vašej aplikácie do Metabase uvidíte chybové hlásenie \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", vaša aplikácia sa pokúša prihlásiť používateľa so nesprávnym slugom tenantu. Skontrolujte claim @tenant v JWT a uistite sa, že sa zhoduje s tenantom, do ktorého tento používateľ tenantu patrí."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "User provisioning disabled for JWT SSO"
msgstr "Provisioning používateľov je pre JWT SSO vypnutý"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO."
msgstr "Ak po presmerovaní z vašej aplikácie do Metabase uvidíte chybové hlásenie \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO.\", provisioning používateľov je pre JWT SSO v nastaveniach správcu/overenie totožnosti vypnutý. Buď túto funkciu zapnite, aby sa používatelia provisionovali, ak ešte neexistujú, alebo sa uistite, že používatelia existujú ešte predtým, než ich prihlásite cez JWT SSO."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Contact customer support"
msgstr "Kontaktovať zákaznícku podporu"

