msgstr "Z.AI API kľúč vypršal alebo je neplatný"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI API endpoint was not found — check the base URL"
msgstr "Koncový bod Z.AI API sa nenašiel — skontrolujte základnú URL adresu"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI has rate limited us"
msgstr "Z.AI nás obmedzilo limitom požiadaviek"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI returned an internal server error"
msgstr "Z.AI vrátilo internú chybu servera"

#: metabase/metabot/self/zai.clj
msgid "Z.AI API error (HTTP {0})"
msgstr "Chyba Z.AI API (HTTP {0})"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Override Metabot ID for agent streaming requests."
msgstr "Prepísať Metabot ID pre streaming požiadavky agenta."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether Metabot is enabled for regular usage."
msgstr "Či je Metabot povolený pre bežné používanie."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The display name for Metabot, shown throughout the Metabase UI."
msgstr "Zobrazované meno pre Metabot, ktoré sa zobrazuje v celom UI Metabase."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The icon for Metabot. Set to `metabot` for the default icon, or a data URI for a custom uploaded image (up to 1MB)."
msgstr "Ikona pre Metabot. Nastavte na `metabot` pre predvolenú ikonu alebo na data URI pre vlastný nahratý obrázok (do 1MB)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether to show Metabot illustrations in the UI."
msgstr "Či zobrazovať ilustrácie Metabot v UI."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the chat experience (the AI sidebar and embedded Metabot)."
msgstr "Vlastné pokyny pripojené k systémovému promptu Metabota pre chat (AI bočný panel a vložený Metabot)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the natural language query (AI exploration) experience."
msgstr "Vlastné pokyny pripojené k systémovému promptu Metabota pre prácu s dotazmi v prirodzenom jazyku (AI prieskum)."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Custom instructions appended to Metabot''s system prompt for the SQL generation experience."
msgstr "Vlastné pokyny pripojené k systémovému promptu Metabota pre generovanie SQL."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether Metabot is enabled for embedding."
msgstr "Či je Metabot povolený pre vkladanie."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Whether the user''s recently viewed items are included in the Metabot system prompt."
msgstr "Či sú do systémového promptu Metabotu zahrnuté položky, ktoré si používateľ nedávno zobrazil."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Invalid Azure model {0}. Expected format: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name> where <family> is one of: {1}"
msgstr "Neplatný Azure model {0}. Očakávaný formát: <connection>/<family>/<deployment-name>, kde <family> je jedno z: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Unsupported model {0} for Metabase managed AI. Supported models: {1}"
msgstr "Nepodporovaný model {0} pre Metabase managed AI. Podporované modely: {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Metabot provider must be a string, got: {0}"
msgstr "Provider Metabot musí byť reťazec, dostal som: {0}"

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Model name is required. Expected format: connection/model, e.g. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""
msgstr "Názov modelu je povinný. Očakávaný formát: connection/model, napr. \"anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5\""

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model for Metabot. Format: connection-key/model-name, e.g. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. The connection key names an entry in the `llm-providers` setting and defaults to the provider type."
msgstr "Pripojenie poskytovateľa AI a model pre Metabot. Formát: connection-key/model-name, napr. `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`, `openai/gpt-5.4`, `openrouter/anthropic/claude-haiku-4.5`. Kľúč pripojenia pomenúva položku v nastavení `llm-providers` a predvolene je to typ poskytovateľa."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "The AI provider connection and model used for quick background tasks, such as naming Metabot conversations, in the same connection-key/model-name format as `llm-metabot-provider`. Defaults to the fastest model offered by the connection Metabot runs on."
msgstr "Pripojenie poskytovateľa AI a model používané na rýchle úlohy na pozadí, ako je pomenovanie konverzácií Metabot, v rovnakom formáte connection-key/model-name ako `llm-metabot-provider`. Predvolene najrýchlejší model ponúkaný pripojením, na ktorom beží Metabot."

#: metabase/metabot/settings.clj
msgid "Number of days to retain rows in the ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation, and metabot_message tables. Minimum value is 30; set to 0 to retain data indefinitely."
msgstr "Počet dní uchovávania riadkov v tabuľkách ai_usage_log, metabot_conversation a metabot_message. Minimálna hodnota je 30; nastavte na 0 pre neobmedzené uchovávanie dát."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "`source-table:` does not accept URIs like `{0}`. {1}"
msgstr "`source-table:` neakceptuje URI ako `{0}`. {1}"

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "Unknown database: `{0}`. Use the exact database name as reported by search / `read_resource` (it appears as the first element of every portable FK, e.g. `source-table: [<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`)."
msgstr "Neznáma databáza: `{0}`. Použite presný názov databázy tak, ako ho hlási search / `read_resource` (zobrazuje sa ako prvý prvok každého portable FK, napr. `source-table: [<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`)."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "Multiple databases share the name `{0}` (ids: {1}). The agent has no way to disambiguate; ask the user to rename one of the databases or use a more specific identifier."
msgstr "Viaceré databázy zdieľajú názov `{0}` (ids: {1}). Agent ich nedokáže rozlíšiť; požiadajte používateľa, aby jednu z databáz premenoval, alebo použite špecifickejší identifikátor."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
#: metabase/models/serialization/resolve/mp.clj
msgid "No saved question or model found with entity_id {0}. Do not invent or guess entity_ids: call `read_resource` with `metabase://question/<numeric id>` or `metabase://model/<numeric id>` first, then copy the exact `portable_entity_id` from the response into `source-card:`."
msgstr "Nenašla sa žiadna uložená otázka ani model s entity_id {0}. Nevymýšľajte ani neháďte entity_ids: najprv zavolajte `read_resource` s `metabase://question/<numeric id>` alebo `metabase://model/<numeric id>`, potom skopírujte presné `portable_entity_id` z odpovede do `source-card:`."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "First stage must have either `source-table:` (as a portable FK `[<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`) or `source-card:` (as an entity_id string). Neither was found in `stages[0]`."
msgstr "Prvá fáza musí mať buď `source-table:` (ako prenosný FK `[<db-name>, <schema>, <table>]`), alebo `source-card:` (ako reťazec entity_id). V `stages[0]` sa nenašlo ani jedno."

#: metabase/metabot/tools/construct.clj
msgid "The constructed query is not runnable - it would fail the query builder''s validation, so it cannot be visualized or saved. This usually means a field reference is missing its type or names a column that does not exist, or an aggregation/window function (e.g. `offset`) was placed in `expressions:` (custom columns) where it is not allowed - move it to `aggregation:` or `order-by:`. Schema validation details: {0}"
msgstr "Zostavený dotaz sa nedá spustiť – neprešiel by validáciou tvorcu dotazov, takže ho nie je možné vizualizovať ani uložiť. Zvyčajne to znamená, že odkazu na pole chýba typ alebo uvádza stĺpec, ktorý neexistuje, alebo že agregačná/oknová funkcia (napr. `offset`) bola umiestnená do `expressions:` (vlastné stĺpce), kde to nie je povolené – presuňte ju do `aggregation:` alebo `order-by:`. Podrobnosti validácie schémy: {0}"

